    {
      "request": "fb950fa8ce69d3706ea7fea06b1131851aeaec7d93c68a249e4c00d7fbde9cad",
      "response": {
        "content": "REQ-1 is not done: no purchase order was created.\n\n- **Quote choice:** S-1 was the cheapest quote at 5.40 USD per unit, against 5.75 from S-2. Both suppliers are allowlisted and both were under the 6.00 limit. The 100 units would have cost 54,000 minor units (540.00 USD).\n- **Failure:** My first attempt to order from S-1 failed with `precondition_failed` (action A-0002). The response gave no further detail.\n- **Budget change:** When I re-read the CC-OPS budget, committed spend had risen from 20,000 to 74,000 against a limit of 100,000. That leaves 26,000, so the 54,000 order no longer fits. I didn't retry.\n\nREQ-1 needs a budget increase, or a decision to order a smaller quantity. At 540 per unit, 26,000 covers at most 48 units, and S-1's minimum quantity is 10. I reported REQ-1 as `not_done` in the final report.",
